  "info": {
    "title": "MICROSERVICE_PROD_File Payment Consents API",
    "description": "The File Payment Consents API facilitates the initiation of bulk file payment transactions within the open banking framework. This API enables financial institutions and payment service providers to securely create and manage payment consents required for processing multiple payments. Typical consumers include banks, fintechs, and businesses needing to streamline payment processes. By leveraging this API, users can enhance their payment workflows and ensure compliance with open banking standards.",
